1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,100
The Ferrari F forty was built in

2
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:04,727
thirteen months, from the leftovers of a

3
00:00:04,727 --> 00:00:07,418
racing programme that had been cancelled.

4
00:00:07,598 --> 00:00:09,837
And it had no door handles,

5
00:00:09,837 --> 00:00:10,914
no glove box,

6
00:00:10,914 --> 00:00:13,485
no leather and no sound system.

7
00:00:13,665 --> 00:00:16,369
Yet it cost about four hundred thousand

8
00:00:16,369 --> 00:00:19,004
dollars, roughly five times the car it

9
00:00:19,004 --> 00:00:22,056
replaced, and speculators sold some for more

10
00:00:22,056 --> 00:00:23,997
than seven times list price.

11
00:00:24,177 --> 00:00:26,886
These are the two secrets hidden inside

12
00:00:26,886 --> 00:00:28,276
the Ferrari F forty.

13
00:00:28,625 --> 00:00:30,019
Here is the twist.

14
00:00:30,199 --> 00:00:32,583
Ferrari planned to build four hundred of

15
00:00:32,583 --> 00:00:32,881
them.

16
00:00:33,061 --> 00:00:35,243
It built more than thirteen hundred.

17
00:00:35,423 --> 00:00:37,673
And the same page that tells us

18
00:00:37,673 --> 00:00:40,069
all that also says only about ten

19
00:00:40,069 --> 00:00:42,900
percent of the cars delivered were used

20
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:44,351
for regular driving.

21
00:00:44,531 --> 00:00:45,730
Stay to the end,

22
00:00:45,730 --> 00:00:49,324
because the sources disagree on several numbers,

23
00:00:49,324 --> 00:00:51,346
and we will show you where.

24
00:00:51,697 --> 00:00:54,554
Every figure comes from a published source,

25
00:00:54,554 --> 00:00:56,282
listed in the description.

26
00:00:56,462 --> 00:00:58,145
Where sources disagree,

27
00:00:58,145 --> 00:00:59,388
we will tell you.

28
00:00:59,568 --> 00:01:01,592
Where we do the maths ourselves,

29
00:01:01,592 --> 00:01:02,540
we will say so.

30
00:01:02,891 --> 00:01:04,562
Start with how it began.

31
00:01:04,742 --> 00:01:08,456
Wikipedia says Nicola Materazzi proposed the concept

32
00:01:08,456 --> 00:01:11,313
to Enzo Ferrari in nineteen eighty-four,

33
00:01:11,313 --> 00:01:13,313
and that the car grew out of

34
00:01:13,313 --> 00:01:16,027
the two eighty-eight G T O Evoluzione.

35
00:01:16,207 --> 00:01:19,165
The Group B racing category ended before

36
00:01:19,165 --> 00:01:21,457
the nineteen eighty-six season,

37
00:01:21,457 --> 00:01:25,376
leaving Ferrari with five Evoluzione development cars

38
00:01:25,376 --> 00:01:27,225
and nowhere to race them.

39
00:01:27,576 --> 00:01:30,359
Project work on the F forty began

40
00:01:30,359 --> 00:01:32,130
on the tenth of June,

41
00:01:32,130 --> 00:01:36,179
nineteen eighty-six, according to the same page.

42
00:01:36,359 --> 00:01:38,937
Enzo Ferrari wanted the car done in

43
00:01:38,937 --> 00:01:40,410
about eleven months.

44
00:01:40,590 --> 00:01:43,615
The car was unveiled on the twenty-first

45
00:01:43,615 --> 00:01:45,958
of July, nineteen eighty-seven,

46
00:01:45,958 --> 00:01:46,941
in Maranello.

47
00:01:47,121 --> 00:01:48,987
By the page's own account,

48
00:01:48,987 --> 00:01:52,575
development took thirteen months from inception to

49
00:01:52,575 --> 00:01:53,077
launch.

50
00:01:53,427 --> 00:01:55,040
By our own arithmetic,

51
00:01:55,040 --> 00:01:58,121
from the tenth of June nineteen eighty-six

52
00:01:58,121 --> 00:02:01,715
to the twenty-first of July nineteen eighty-seven

53
00:02:01,715 --> 00:02:04,282
is thirteen months and eleven days.

54
00:02:04,462 --> 00:02:06,076
That agrees with the page.

55
00:02:06,256 --> 00:02:08,418
Compare it with the other cars in

56
00:02:08,418 --> 00:02:09,205
this series.

57
00:02:09,385 --> 00:02:11,810
The Lexus LFA took about ten and

58
00:02:11,810 --> 00:02:14,690
a half years from start to production.

59
00:02:14,870 --> 00:02:17,735
The Mercedes-AMG One took more than five

60
00:02:17,735 --> 00:02:20,170
years from its reveal to its first

61
00:02:20,170 --> 00:02:20,815
delivery.

62
00:02:21,165 --> 00:02:22,082
A caution.

63
00:02:22,262 --> 00:02:23,691
One of our sources,

64
00:02:23,691 --> 00:02:26,776
Classic Motorsports, says the F forty was

65
00:02:26,776 --> 00:02:31,065
presented in nineteen eighty-seven for Ferrari's fortieth

66
00:02:31,065 --> 00:02:31,968
anniversary.

67
00:02:32,148 --> 00:02:35,089
Another source, a vehicle archive page,

68
00:02:35,089 --> 00:02:37,955
says Enzo Ferrari presented the car at

69
00:02:37,955 --> 00:02:40,971
Maranello in June nineteen eighty-seven.

70
00:02:41,151 --> 00:02:44,344
Wikipedia gives the twenty-first of July.

71
00:02:44,524 --> 00:02:45,445
We use July,

72
00:02:45,445 --> 00:02:47,595
since Wikipedia is specific,

73
00:02:47,595 --> 00:02:49,667
and we flag the difference.

74
00:02:50,018 --> 00:02:52,185
The F forty was built to mark

75
00:02:52,185 --> 00:02:55,698
Ferrari's fortieth anniversary and was the last

76
00:02:55,698 --> 00:02:59,136
Ferrari that Enzo Ferrari personally approved,

77
00:02:59,136 --> 00:03:00,258
Wikipedia says.

78
00:03:00,438 --> 00:03:02,978
Classic Motorsports adds that he died in

79
00:03:02,978 --> 00:03:05,708
nineteen eighty-eight at the age of ninety.

80
00:03:05,888 --> 00:03:08,415
The vehicle archive page says the car

81
00:03:08,415 --> 00:03:11,624
was presented fourteen months before his death.

82
00:03:11,804 --> 00:03:12,952
By our arithmetic,

83
00:03:12,952 --> 00:03:15,184
that puts his death in about August

84
00:03:15,184 --> 00:03:16,587
nineteen eighty-eight.

85
00:03:16,937 --> 00:03:18,945
The engine was inherited too.

86
00:03:19,125 --> 00:03:22,130
Wikipedia describes the F one twenty A,

87
00:03:22,130 --> 00:03:23,285
a two thousand,

88
00:03:23,285 --> 00:03:26,444
nine hundred thirty-six cubic centimetre,

89
00:03:26,444 --> 00:03:30,527
twin-turbocharged, intercooled ninety-degree V eight,

90
00:03:30,527 --> 00:03:33,840
an enlarged version of the two eighty-eight

91
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:34,996
G T O's engine.

92
00:03:35,176 --> 00:03:39,154
It claims four hundred seventy-eight metric horsepower

93
00:03:39,154 --> 00:03:41,143
at seven thousand r p m and

94
00:03:41,143 --> 00:03:45,416
five hundred seventy-seven newton-metres at four thousand.

95
00:03:45,596 --> 00:03:47,583
The U S version is listed at

96
00:03:47,583 --> 00:03:49,358
four hundred eighty-four.

97
00:03:49,708 --> 00:03:53,028
Other sources describe the same engine differently.

98
00:03:53,208 --> 00:03:56,429
The vehicle archive says about five hundred

99
00:03:56,429 --> 00:03:59,276
brake horsepower at seven thousand r p

100
00:03:59,276 --> 00:04:01,523
m, with two water-cooled I H I

101
00:04:01,523 --> 00:04:04,145
turbochargers at one point one bar.

102
00:04:04,325 --> 00:04:09,185
Classic Motorsports says four hundred seventy-eight horsepower

103
00:04:09,185 --> 00:04:11,771
at a factory boost of about eight

104
00:04:11,771 --> 00:04:13,025
