00:04:13,025 --> 00:04:14,358
or point six bar,

106
00:04:14,358 --> 00:04:16,945
and over five hundred at one bar.

107
00:04:17,125 --> 00:04:19,410
The sources disagree about boost,

108
00:04:19,410 --> 00:04:21,142
